## 6. Validation Criteria

 Unit tests run without AWS infrastructure (InMemory Adapter)
 GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline executes automatically on push
 Production deployment to EC2 with RDS persistence works correctly
 Domain logic remains independent of technology choices
 Architecture supports scaling from 1 to 100,000 users conceptually

