### Process View
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant API as REST Controller
    participant CaseUse as Use Case<br/>RegisterProgress
    participant Repo as Repository<br/>Output Port
    participant DB as AWS RDS<br/>PostgreSQL
    
    User->>API: POST /api/certifications/1/progress<br/>{ hours: 10 }
    API->>CaseUse: RegisterProgress(certId, hours)
    
    CaseUse->>CaseUse: Validate hours > 0
    CaseUse->>Repo: GetCertification(certId)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM Certifications WHERE Id = 1
    DB-->>Repo: Certification Entity
    Repo-->>CaseUse: Domain Object
    
    CaseUse->>CaseUse: Validate certification exists
    CaseUse->>CaseUse: Update accumulated progress
    CaseUse->>CaseUse: Calculate % completion
    CaseUse->>CaseUse: If % >= 100: mark as completed
    
    CaseUse->>Repo: SaveCertification(cert)
    Repo->>DB: UPDATE Certifications SET AccumulatedHours=X WHERE Id=1
    DB-->>Repo: OK
    Repo-->>CaseUse: Successfully saved
    
    CaseUse-->>API: DTO { id, progress, completed }
    API-->>User: HTTP 200 OK<br/>{ certificationId: 1, progressPercentage: 85 }
```

